PROJECT NAME: VISHWAS DEVELOPER ERP

Build a Completely New Web Application and Mobile Application

1. MAIN INSTRUCTION

Build a completely new, professional, simple, secure, responsive Real Estate and Construction Management ERP named Vishwas Developer ERP.

IMPORTANT:

- This is a completely NEW project.
- Do not modify, replace, connect to, or disturb my existing ERP project.
- Do not reuse or overwrite the old project's files, database, settings, or code.
- Create a separate new codebase, separate database, separate authentication system, and separate file storage.
- Build the new software using this prompt as the complete requirements document.
- Develop both a Web Application and a Mobile Application using the same backend and database.
- Both applications must show the same live data after an authorized user logs in.
- Do not create only a UI design, static prototype, or demo.
- Implement real forms, database operations, calculations, reports, authentication, and business logic.
- Do not use fake data or dummy dashboard figures.
- If any external service or API requires credentials, clearly explain the setup steps instead of pretending it is connected.

2. APPLICATIONS REQUIRED

Create the following two applications:

A. Web Application

- Works on desktop computers, laptops, tablets, and mobile browsers.
- Simple navigation and compact sidebar.
- Responsive forms and tables.
- Print-friendly receipts, bills, and reports.
- Excel/CSV export for supported reports.
- Easy-to-use dashboard.

B. Mobile Application

- Android-compatible mobile application.
