- Keep the same backend and database as the Web Application.

Do not create two separate databases. A transaction entered through the mobile application must also appear in the web application after it is saved successfully.

Keep the architecture suitable for future expansion and app distribution. Do not publish the application to the Play Store unless specifically requested.

